<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:50:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着中国竞争对手的推进，Stellantis 将暂停更多欧洲工厂</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance</link><description>Stellantis NV 计划在未来几周内在欧洲进一步停工，因为该汽车制造商正在努力应对日益激烈的竞争、高成本和某些车型需求疲软的问题。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance'&gt;随着中国竞争对手的推进，Stellantis 将暂停更多欧洲工厂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stellantis to Pause More Europe Plants as Chinese Rivals Advance&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:49:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</link><description>金价在周三上涨后小幅走低，因通胀数据强化了美联储将进一步加息的押注。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes'&gt;美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Hovers Near 15-Month Low as Traders Eye Fed Path, AI Stocks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria, Japan Tobacco Explore Takeover of Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>